// How situations are weighed, learned: each Weighs("feature", value) replaces the prior weight of
// that feature (src/situation/situation.ts PRIOR). A softmax over each GSM8K train situation's readings (3,000), the right ones pulled up, L2 to the prior: held-out 110 -> 123 of 750, test 0-399 78 -> 84. Written by scripts/keep-weights.mjs.
Requires(Core(), Basic())

Concept(Weighs(), IsA(Relation()))

